abstract: >-
  A working library for Contribution Analysis, a theory-based approach to impact
  evaluation: an eight-lesson interactive course with reference cards, a verified
  annotated bibliography with BibTeX and an errata page, five design templates,
  and a red team protocol for checking that a Contribution Analysis was done
  properly.
